        ["Deploy"] = "Distribuisci",
        ["coworkee deploy"] = "coworkee deploy",
        ["Writing the deployment…"] = "Scrittura del deployment…",
        ["Docker Compose for one host, Azure Container Apps (Bicep) or Kubernetes (Helm). The tools of the app go along."] = "Docker Compose per un singolo host, Azure Container Apps (Bicep) o Kubernetes (Helm). Gli strumenti dell'app vengono inclusi.",
